  lectureTitle: Enemy AI
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4f0041d9352cb74f87ecbf1d123b156, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'Enemy AI with a State Machine. The Enemy has various states,
    it looks for a Target (the Player) then when it finds it chases the target and
    finally attacks when in range.


    In this Scenario the Enemy walks automatically
    left, then it should approach the Player, find the target and shoot it.'
